# Keep LF everywhere, including Windows checkouts.
#
# Not cosmetic: the CLI's first line is "#!/usr/bin/env node". Built from a
# CRLF checkout it becomes "node\r", and `npx stuff-transfer` then fails on
# Linux and macOS with "env: node\r: No such file or directory".
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
*.tgz binary
